# The CAAIL chat backend's ask endpoint (POST { query } -> { answer }).
# No API key needed client-side. Leave it unset to build without the Ask CAAIL
# box, which is how the site ships while the feature is not offered. Set it in
# the shell rather than in site/.env: the chat e2e specs read the shell only and
# refuse to run when site/.env sets it (e2e/chat-build.ts).
# PUBLIC_CAAIL_CHAT_API=https://<backend-host>/caail/ask
